---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-date-picker</code> is a calendar for picking a date. It is the calendar inside
  <code>wc-date-field</code>; use it on its own where the calendar should stay on the page, such as a
  booking panel. For a form input, use <code>wc-date-field</code>.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-date-picker id='date-picker-demo' value='2026-11-06'></wc-date-picker>
  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelector('#date-picker-demo').addEventListener('change', function (event) {
      myConsole.log('change :: ' + event.detail.value);
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<p>
  The value is an ISO date (<code>2026-11-06</code>), whatever the locale. Click the month name to
  switch to a month grid, and again for a decade of years, to jump further than the arrows go.
</p>
